  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK Contribution to International Fund for Agricultural Development 9th Replenishment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support IFAD&#x2019;s work in enabling poor rural people to improve their food security and nutrition and increase their incomes.  IFAD loans and grants will reach 90 million people in the 2013 &#x2013; 2015 replenishment period, helping them to create economic opportunities through: increasing agricultural productivity; improving infrastucture; reaching markets; accessing financial services; adapting to climate change and empowering women. This will contribute, in particular, to achieving the first Millennium Development Goal of eradicating extreme poverty and hunger.  IFAD aims to lift 80 million people out of poverty by 2015.</narrative>
  </description>
